<title>GERMANY: Jordan's King Hussein to visit Bonn next week.</title>
<headline>Jordan's King Hussein to visit Bonn next week.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>King Hussein of Jordan is due to visit Bonn next week and will meet with German Chancellor Helmut Kohl, the government press office said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The king is set to meet Kohl at 4 p.m. (1500 GMT) on February 17 and continue his visit on the following day.</p>
<p>The king flew to Britain on Saturday on the first leg of the foreign tour which will also take in Ireland and Morocco.</p>
</text>
